msgid "(RPO, ORSR, ŽRSR, RÚZ, Finančná správa), licensed CC-BY 4.0."
msgstr "(RPO, ORSR, ŽRSR, RÚZ, Finančná správa), licencia CC-BY 4.0."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk.res_config_settings_view_form_partner_autocomplete_provider_orsf_sk
msgid ""
".\n"
"                                    Install them and the mappings below point at those fields\n"
"                                    automatically — no mapping to set up, and the values feed the\n"
"                                    § 3a statement, the § 69/12 warning and the dissolved-partner\n"
"                                    banner. Without them you can still aim each value at a field of\n"
"                                    your own, but only this module will understand it."
msgstr ""
". Po ich nainštalovaní sa mapovania nižšie nasmerujú na tieto polia "
"automaticky — nič netreba nastavovať a hodnoty napĺňajú vetu podľa § 3a, "
"upozornenie na § 69 ods. 12 a upozornenie na zrušený subjekt. Bez nich "
"môžete každú hodnotu nasmerovať do vlastného poľa, rozumieť mu však bude len"
" tento modul."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
". Identity only — run Update on a partner to refresh its register "
"coordinates, VAT paragraph and activities."
msgstr ""
". Len identifikačné údaje — pre údaje o zápise, § registrácie DPH a predmety"
" podnikania spustite na partnerovi akciu Aktualizovať."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk.res_config_settings_view_form_partner_autocomplete_provider_orsf_sk
msgid ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-info-circle me-1\"/>\n"
"                                    These register values already have fields of their own in"
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-info-circle me-1\"/> Tieto hodnoty z registra už majú "
"vlastné polia v moduloch"

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk.res_config_settings_view_form_partner_autocomplete_provider_orsf_sk
msgid ""
"<strong>Field mapping</strong> — where each register value is\n"
"                                written. These are pointed at the standard SK fields automatically\n"
"                                whenever the module owning them is installed; the button re-applies\n"
"                                that. Aim one somewhere else and the value follows it; clear one and\n"
"                                the value is not stored at all."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Mapovanie polí</strong> — kam sa zapisuje ktorá hodnota z registra. "
"Ak je nainštalovaný modul, ktorý dané pole obsahuje, mapovanie sa naň "
"nasmeruje automaticky; tlačidlo to zopakuje. Ak niektoré nasmerujete inam, "
"hodnota pôjde tam; ak ho vymažete, hodnota sa neuloží vôbec."

