#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk.field_res_config_settings__config_orsf_sk_login_password
msgid ""
"ORSF issues no API key for its gated endpoints, so a sign-in is the only way"
" in. Stored in ir.config_parameter, which is PLAIN TEXT in the database and "
"in every backup — use a dedicated ORSF account for this, never a personal "
"one."
msgstr ""
"ORSF nevydáva API kľúč pre chránené koncové body, prihlásenie je preto "
"jediná možnosť. Ukladá sa do ir.config_parameter, teda v OTVORENOM TEXTE v "
"databáze aj v každej zálohe — použite na to vyhradené konto ORSF, nikdy nie "
"osobné."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk.res_config_settings_view_form_partner_autocomplete_provider_orsf_sk
msgid ""
"ORSF issues no API key for the person and ownership-graph\n"
"                                endpoints, so signing in is the only way to reach them.\n"
"                                The password is stored in <code>ir.config_parameter</code>,\n"
"                                which is <strong>plain text</strong> in the database and in\n"
"                                every backup — use a dedicated ORSF account, not a personal one."
msgstr ""
"ORSF nevydáva API kľúč pre koncové body osôb a grafu vlastníckych vzťahov, "
"prihlásenie je preto jediná cesta k nim. Heslo sa ukladá do "
"<code>ir.config_parameter</code>, teda v <strong>otvorenom texte</strong> v "
"databáze aj v každej zálohe — použite vyhradené konto ORSF, nie osobné."

