msgid ""
"Only the person and graph endpoints need an account; everything this module "
"does otherwise works anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Konto vyžadujú len koncové body pre osoby a graf vzťahov; všetko ostatné "
"funguje anonymne."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk.field_res_config_settings__config_orsf_sk_api_token
msgid ""
"Optional Bearer token from your ORSF account. Raises the request quota and "
"unlocks the full address of a sole trader, which ORSF otherwise withholds "
"(addressLocked). Anonymous access works without one. This is an API token, "
"never an account password."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľný Bearer token z vášho konta ORSF. Zvyšuje limit požiadaviek a "
"sprístupní úplnú adresu živnostníka, ktorú ORSF inak zadržiava "
"(addressLocked). Anonymný prístup funguje aj bez neho. Ide o API token, "
"nikdy nie o heslo ku kontu."

